  "metaDescription": "The BJP has criticized Rahul Gandhi for his recent social media posts, including his interpretation of an Ardhanareshwar image used to target the RSS.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "Rahul Gandhi shared an Ardhanareshwar image to criticize the BJP and RSS as casteist and male chauvinists.",
