  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The political discourse in India has intensified following social media activity by Rahul Gandhi. Gandhi used an image of Ardhanareshwar, a composite form of Shiva and Parvati, to label the Bharatiya Janata Party (BJP) and the Rashtriya Swayamsevak Sangh (RSS) as casteist and male chauvinistic. In response, BJP leadership alleged that Gandhi continues to disparage the country’s traditions and economy, suggesting his rhetoric mirrors past controversial comments regarding Sanatan Dharma. Simultaneously, a Hindu seer has written to both Rahul and Priyanka Gandhi, arguing that the image contains complex symbolic meanings that merit further contemplation beyond political interpretation. These developments follow a series of recent criticisms directed at the BJP government by Gandhi regarding issues such as the response to recent hooch-related deaths in Manipur and the broader state of the national economy.",
